     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "德國國家圖書館的人名權威檔稱他為日本天皇「大正」，記他生於1879年，卒於1926年，卒地為葉山，簡註寫他在位為1912至1926年。日本宮內廳的年表則記載，嘉仁親王於明治12年（1879年）8月31日誕生。",
      "en": "The German National Library authority record lists him as Taishō, Emperor of Japan, born in 1879 and died in 1926 at Hayama, and its short note gives his reign as 1912–1926. The Imperial Household Agency chronology records the birth of Prince Yoshihito (Emperor Taishō) on 31 August 1879 (Meiji 12)."
     },
