     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "德國國家圖書館的人名權威檔稱他為阿爾巴尼亞國王索古一世，記他生於1895年，地點為阿爾巴尼亞的布爾加杰特，1961年卒於絮雷訥。該檔簡註概括他的經歷：1922年任總理，1925年任總統，1928至1939年為國王，1939年義大利入侵後流亡。",
      "en": "The German National Library authority record lists him as Zogu I, King of Albania, born in 1895 at Burgajet in Albania and died in 1961 at Suresnes. Its short note summarises his career: prime minister in 1922, president in 1925, king 1928–1939, and in exile from 1939 after the Italian invasion."
     },
