     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "1921至1922年的崛起",
      "en": "Rise in 1921–1922"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "美國國會圖書館的阿爾巴尼亞國別研究寫道，索古屬人民黨，當時二十四歲，是中部穆斯林部族馬蒂酋長之子。1921年12月，人民黨領袖賈費爾·伊皮組成政府，索古任內政部長。他其後留守首都，在英國大使協助下擊退進攻，後來接任總理。",
      "en": "The Library of Congress country study says Zogu belonged to the Popular Party and was the twenty-four-year-old son of the chief of the Mati, a central Albanian Muslim tribe. In December 1921 the party head Xhafer Ypi formed a government with Zogu as internal affairs minister. Zogu later stayed in the capital and, with the British ambassador's help, repulsed the assault; he later took over the premiership."
     },
