      "en": "Return, presidency and kingship"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "國會圖書館國別研究記載，1924年12月13日索古的南斯拉夫支持軍越境進入阿爾巴尼亞；他其後被選為總統，任期七年，該文寫的日期是1月31日。《Origins》文章稱，1925年1月31日他當選新共和國總統，並說1928年9月1日他解散共和國，自立為國王，統治到1939年墨索里尼命令義軍入侵為止。",
      "en": "The Library of Congress study records that on 13 December 1924 Zogu's Yugoslav-backed army crossed into Albanian territory and that he was elected president for a seven-year term on 31 January. Origins says he was elected president of the new republic on 31 January 1925, dissolved the republic and declared himself king on 1 September 1928, and ruled until 1939, when Mussolini ordered Italian forces to invade."
     },
